            "review_title": "Review at Tiem An Crown",
            "review_text": "MONDRON\nHartlepool, United Kingdom545 contributions\n0\nFreshest seafood!!\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nWe dropped in here for a meal we were welcomed and given menus, the menu had no English translation at all. We decided to stay & take pot luck no one spoke any English so this was going to be fun!! \n\nWe ordered local beers and with hand gestures we said to serve us whatever was recommended, the waiter brought us a plug in cooking plate, a pan with boiling stock, a sieve and a fabulous platter of fresh seafood! \n\nWe were clearly unsure what to do next, the waiter kindly cooked all the seafood at different intervals drained in the sieve and served it to us, wow we couldn’t believe the freshness and the taste of the sea in the oysters, clams, prawns, fish, octopus etc. We were given a dip and soy sauce some salad and a bowl of morning glory. We didn’t leave a thing it was delicious, they then brought us a type of donut bread fro dessert, we were so pleased we didn’t run off and go elsewhere what a great experience and great meal thank you! Needless to say it was so cheap too around £18 for the two of us amazing!\nRead more\nWritten March 4, 2019",
